 to know if I could request another one please!\nThe same characters (my FF14 character and G’raha Tia), in a pose kind of like this one (https://imgur.com/a/C1zMsHt) but instead their foreheads touching. The background and everything else is up to you! She doesn’t need to wear the outfit in the reference pictures, really, anything you want to put her in is fine.\nThank you so much!\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/UoXWkOB", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@nawofu_mochi/works/7", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/b2b5e6b4/uploads/origins/f5c6e430-4ca9-48ed-9fbb-f6252c8de34a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=2644a907f4bf91275053a58477e4a7dd", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b2b5e6b4/uploads/origins/f5c6e430-4ca9-48ed-9fbb-f6252c8de34a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=2644a907f4bf91275053a58477e4a7dd, https://si.imgix.net/b2b5e6b4/uploads/origins/f5c6e430-4ca9-48ed-9fbb-f6252c8de34a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=cc691be6ba155bc185c80a8336f1a5cc 2x, https://si.imgix.net/b2b5e6b4/uploads/origins/f5c6e430-4ca9-48ed-9fbb-f6252c8de34a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=050b429ebd4ce675731e7815fd67e3d1 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@nawofu_mochi/works/6", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/7ba78171/uploads/origins/572b0b3e-f392-43eb-9536-52e9c454282b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4785cd316b10f1862ba34e587